Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.84,0:00:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can tell you about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.80,0:00:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I worked uptown long before any of you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.33,0:00:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,knew a pussy was good for more than peeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, an old friend visited me not long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.20,0:00:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He works as a street sweeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.38,0:00:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's a bit worn now, but back then he was handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.98,0:00:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go and see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.46,0:00:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He knew your father very well, I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.72,0:00:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They were thick as thieves back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.22,0:00:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So if some things have got a bit foggy over time,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.97,0:00:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,you should go see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He works down in the suburbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He sweeps the streets.
